            "ClerkNotes": "Prosecution\u0027s strongest evidence but heavily weakened on cross. GSR on right hand is consistent with firing a weapon — but also consistent with being in the room when someone else fired. Low particle count favors defense. No GSR on left hand suggests no two-handed shooting stance. No hand-washing suggests no consciousness of guilt re: GSR.",
